WEBVTT

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:49.130
Spinach, liver, and prunes.

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:52.670
I've gotten sick of eating this every day.

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:56.190
But this is for Mai. It's a test.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.130
Mitsugu is definitely hiding something.

00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:09.760
Hiding something? You mean my goddess?

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:12.420
She's definitely not normal.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:15.870
Indeed. It's unbelievable that 
she's smaller than a D cup.

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:19.820
An ordinary human couldn't 
pull of that stunt.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:48.310
It's worth investigating if that was 
some kind of illusion or magic.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.990
Yeah. Let's investigate that body's secrets.

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:56.400
I feel like we're not 
seeing things eye to eye.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.400
Eye to eye?

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.800
Eye for an eye.

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:00.830
Tooth for a tooth.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:06.360
Teeth?!

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:09.570
Bite me. Bite me as hard as you can.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.330
Make a mess of me.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.460
He's truly loyal and greedy.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.320
He's a typical type O person.

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:31.140
Isn't that...?

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.270
Who is he?

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.790
Something like a follower 
or stalker of mine.

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:39.860
I see. Why didn't I think of that sooner?

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:45.120
<b>Torture Club</b>

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:08.390
<b>Torture Club Captain
Uemura Kanji</b>

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:09.660
Talk.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.360
What is this?

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:18.970
You think you can get away with abducting, 
confining, and doing this to a girl?

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:22.120
People don't even get away 
with this in anime and manga!

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:25.440
You've got suspension, expulsion, 
and prison waiting for you!

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:29.980
You think we'd torture people if we were 
afraid of being suspended or expelled?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.130
You don't need to torture anybody.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:37.100
I happened to hear a curious rumor.

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:41.100
Sounds like you've hanging around Nami-chan.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:44.210
She's rather frightened of you.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:46.820
What? I've been following Nami?

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:50.010
<i>Oh, right. This guy worships Nami.</i>

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:51.630
I can't have that.

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:55.390
Personally, I can't let this one go.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.330
I think I'll inflict a little pain on you.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:59.510
I already am.

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:01.560
You haven't seen anything yet.

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:05.500
This isn't what you call true pain.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:09.170
Please don't. You've got the wrong idea.

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:13.230
<i>Even if that were true, I'd never 
stalk that strong-willed fisherwoman.</i>

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:15.730
Even if what were true?

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:17.180
My thoughts were escaping my head again.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:20.610
You bitch! You dare to ridicule my muse?

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:24.090
No! I don't know if she's your 
muse or chemise or whatever,

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.880
but in any case, Nami is either 
confused or full of herself.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.760
Confused? Full of herself?

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.640
My Nami-san?

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.870
You think she cares about 
a fujoshi like yourself?

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:38.210
That's she's self-conscious? I see.

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:44.810
Boys, let's teach this scum exactly 
what it means to be confused.

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:48.960
Torture her, torture her, torture her.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.010
Like you're torturing her to death.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:51.900
Do it.

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.300
Yeah.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:55.200
Hold it.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:06:00.950
Looks like you guys have been 
taking good care of my underling.

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:05.420
You're Katsuno, the Rising and Falling 
Battleship of the Karate Club.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:11.310
Don't you think you overdid it?

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:14.500
I held back. They'll live.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.970
And I'll get my Mousenyland 
date with Nami-chan.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:18.300
You're certain, right?

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:19.510
Indeed.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.100
If this rehabilitates you,

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.990
you two can screw off to Mousenyland 
or the afterlife for all I care!

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:29.400
Anyway, you owe me a favor now.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:30.450
Isn't that right?

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.080
Yeah, I guess.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.840
Seriously, thanks. Later.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.610
You're not going anywhere.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:40.740
You're going to tell me 
all about my goddess.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:45.870
She's a relative of mine who just 
happened to come to the cosplay party.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:49.070
Transforming and vanishing is 
a little parlor trick of hers.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.990
I don't care about that!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:53.820
Tell me her measurements and 
what type of men she likes.

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:54.560
What?

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:58.780
My estimates are 85, 54, and 85.

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:00.840
Does she like macho men?

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:06.120
I'm asking if she likes men 
with bodies like mine!

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:15.530
<b>Torture Club</b>

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:11.400
What the hell is he asking her?

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:15.540
Idiots are useless.

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:19.770
So, who is my goddess?

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:23.990
I'm asking you where she 
is and what she's doing!

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:27.050
I told you, I don't know!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.240
Liar!

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:33.890
I won't let you keep her all to yourself.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.890
You have to share.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.890
<b>Anti-monopoly Law</b>

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.090
Haven't you heard of the Anti-monopoly Law?

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:43.540
If you haven't, then I'll 
teach you all about it!

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:52.350
I gave him a sedative that would 
instantly knock out a gorilla.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:57.200
<b>One Blow</b>

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:53.520
Piece of cake.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.810
That's terrifying.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:57.570
This is no time to be scared.

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:01.780
You need to get that vampire girl 
out of your house immediately.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:02.540
What?

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:06.630
I passed that fisherwoman on my way here.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:07.620
Nami?

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:11.760
<i>Which means she's the one behind this.</i>

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:24.220
Mai, how do things look outside?

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:26.980
One, two, three...

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:33.140
Damn that Katsuno. He's persistent.

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:34.960
What are they doing?

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:36.930
They've come to find you.

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:40.250
Oh, my. Then I should 
prepare some tea for them.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.820
We're escaping out the back.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:47.080
<b>Chimatsuri Laboratory</b>

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:50.950
You made it. I'll take good care of you.

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:53.860
I'm Mai. Thank you for having me.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:57.290
I regret having to do this, 
but we had nowhere else to go.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:01.470
Why not take this opportunity 
to leave her with me?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:05.110
What? No. Absolutely not!

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:09.470
That starry-eyed gorilla isn't the 
only one interested in this girl.

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:12.170
That fisherwoman is plotting something, too.

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:14.620
You're the one who's most interested in her.

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.350
Shut up!

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:19.490
She seems to be in good health, 
and she's not anemic, either.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.940
Anyway, as promised...

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:25.420
Don't. This is no time to be doing that.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.380
<b>SLAP SLAP SLAP</b>

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:28.480
You shut up!

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:30.700
A mere two liters will do.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:32.300
It won't hurt at all.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.290
Come on, roll up your sleeve.

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:38.060
Come on, it's for scientific progress.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:41.820
Give me your blood!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:51.530
Mai, are you okay?

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:54.570
That was scary.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:57.120
A woman has no home anywhere. 
She's surrounded by enemies.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:00.020
We can't trust anyone.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.900
Where's my goddess?!

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:09.450
Yikes. Katsuno must be out of his 
mind to break into a teacher's home.

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:10.970
Mai, let's run.

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:11.610
Okay.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:14.170
You won't get away!

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:20.930
Tell us that girl's true identity.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:25.600
Mai's identity is none of your business.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.200
It is my business.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:33.800
I'm an extremely curious girl.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:35.030
<b>Curiosity</b>

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:37.970
Nami, you have to share.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.060
Katsuno.

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:41.930
<i>We're out of the frying 
pan and into the fire.</i>

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.460
Shut up! Go die, you filthy man!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:46.800
Looks like this is the end of our alliance.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:50.440
Teaming up with a meathead 
gorilla like you was a mistake.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:52.510
Let's settle this!

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:55.040
I'd have no other way!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:10:59.650
Get them.

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:00.850
Osu!

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:03.640
How many times do I have to tell you

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:08.050
not to speak pointless words 
like "osu" in my presence?!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:10.050
Hurricane Kick!

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.520
I've been deceived.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:19.780
You really are amazingly stupid to 
defeat your own underlings first.

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.730
Get him.

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:23.150
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:28.790
<b>Rump</b>

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:30.700
Scene 7, cut 48. Take one.

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:36.230
Cut! What are you guys doing?

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:37.770
Don't give us that crap.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:40.540
Maki, where did you come from?

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:46.440
I knew when heard Mitsugu had been kidnapped 
by the perverts in the Torture Club.

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:50.150
Their captain Uemura is your stalker.

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:53.150
You resorted to using force.

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.440
You're interested in her, too.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:58.650
It's my nature to be a documentary maker.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.820
I can't become a subject.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:04.600
Now let's rewind and do that again!

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:05.580
We're filming!

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:06.700
Take two!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.710
Nami, give us some flashier action!

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:12.360
How is this a documentary?

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.030
Punch, punch, punch, kick.

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:18.400
Once more. Punch, punch, punch, kick.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.440
What are you doing here?

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:22.950
It's <i>Virtua Fighter 2</i>'s Renkan Tenshinkyaku.

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:26.030
You practice karate, but you've 
never heard of it? Pathetic.

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:27.780
Let go of her.

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:33.400
Breaking into a teacher's home, 
unauthorized photography,

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:32.890
<b>Breaking Into a Teacher's Home</b>

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:35.150
<b>Unauthorized Photography</b>

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:36.130
and a cosplay that nearly 
infringes upon copyright.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.610
<b>Copyright Infringement</b>

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:39.850
I won't allow anymore illegal activities!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.870
What's Jinko doing here?

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:43.980
Actually, I don't even 
feel like asking anymore!

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:47.420
You're making me feel like an idiot 
for providing my own explanation.

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:49.610
Anyway, Mitsugu...

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:54.090
By some twist of fate, 
all concerned parties have shown up,

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.880
and we're running out of time.

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:57.420
Why don't you spill the beans?

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.970
Tell us the true identity of that Mai girl.

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.010
Tell us.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:02.270
Talk.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:03.510
Talk!

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:06.570
You going say, "Look, a UFO"?

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:08.830
Dam up all you want; you 
won't trick us that easily.

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.250
You mean "clam up."

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:12.140
Mai, no!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.320
Hey, wait.

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.470
Could it be?

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:20.090
That girl is drinking blood.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:21.990
It's tomato juice.

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:25.100
Delicious.

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:27.960
Don't act so pleased. 
What did you just drink?

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:29.450
Oh, jeez.

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:32.870
<b>Super Secret</b>

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:32.800
Why'd you have to drink 
something suspect again?

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:57.160
Mai!

00:13:57.470 --> 00:13:58.290
Did you see that?

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.330
I sure did.

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:00.610
She's a monster.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:01.990
A dragon.

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:05.620
Doctor, what kind of blood did Mai drink?

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:09.070
<b>SLAP SLAP SLAP</b>

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:09.360
How long do you plan on being sedated?!

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:13.600
Doctor, Mai drank the whole bottle.

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:15.070
What kind of blood was it?

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:17.060
You're asking me?

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.480
I've been asking you.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:20.640
Hurry up and explain yourselves.

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:22.330
Why was she drinking blood?

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:23.490
What is that monster?

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:24.840
It's a dragon.

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:31.250
It happened when I was working 
as a university lab assistant.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.770
Give us the abridged version! 
What happened after that?

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:38.690
<b>SLAP SLAP SLAP</b>

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:38.300
Shut up and listen while 
others are speaking!

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:43.970
My academic advisor was a talented 
individual with a promising future

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:50.050
and a refined middle-aged 
man like Walter Matthau.

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:58.590
Oh, but I... Yes.

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:03.210
As though guided by fate 
itself, we fell in love.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:07.210
However, the love between a professor 
and his assistant is forbidden.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:10.880
Not only that, but he had roughly 
one wife he married in poverty

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:13.810
and four or so children he had to support.

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:17.050
Furthermore, he had a 40-year mortgage.

00:15:17.050 --> 00:15:20.330
And furthermore, he kept a combined 
total of 12 cats and dogs as pets,

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:25.320
and had to support this large household 
on the meager salary of a public servant.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.340
You don't have much luck with men.

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:29.520
He's got way bigger problems 
that just being a shitty man.

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:34.120
Our love ended before spring arrived.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:38.100
It's what you'd expect if you 
have any amount of sense.

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:42.000
With what little severance pay I received, 
I dropped out of college and,

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:44.310
out of desperation, traveled 
to relieve my broken heart—

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:48.400
rather, in order to collect blood, 
I traveled to the farthest reaches of Europe.

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:52.420
At a forgotten and desolate abandoned school,

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:55.520
a two hour walk outside a 
ghost town deep in Wales,

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:58.130
I see you're the type to get carried 
away to the end of the line.

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:03.770
That's where I finally, 
finally laid my hands on it.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:06.140
Found what?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:09.300
You'll be shocked to hear 
and flabbergasted to see...

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:11.230
I'm already flabbergasted.

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:15.620
The blood that vampire 
drank every last drop of

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:20.990
was the lifeblood of a salamander.

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.120
A salamander?

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.960
What's a salamander?

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.750
Is it a relative of Nanmaider?

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.200
Fools!

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:32.470
It is a terrifying fire drake, born from flame, 
who destroys the world with its fiery breath,

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:35.160
the legendary salamander.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:54.730
Doctor, how long will the 
effects of that blood last?

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:55.870
Doctor!

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:57.900
I don't know.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.720
But she drank quite a lot of its blood.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:04.870
If we don't do something, 
this city will be reduced to ashes.

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.460
What?!

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.180
So, what are we supposed to do?

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:10.530
I told you, I don't know.

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.320
How irresponsible.

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:14.350
We need the blood of an ice dragon.

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.600
No, the blood of a frost 
giant would be better.

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:19.810
Fools! Nothing so convenient exists.

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:23.960
Even if it did, how would we get her 
to drink it under these circumstances?

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:27.690
Does that mean we just have 
to wait until it wears off?

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:33.730
Well, half the town already burned down 
during Doctor Chihiro's very long flashback.

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:40.230
Wow, those are ASDF F-2s.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:42.080
They're armed for air-to-air combat, too.

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.340
Look, there are JGSDF Apaches, too.

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:47.240
Idiot. The JGSDF is scheduled 
to procure Apaches,

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:48.760
but they haven't been deployed yet.

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:51.170
Horita, your information is outdated.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.380
They were cut off after 13 helicopters,

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:56.250
but they've already been deployed 
to Metabaru and Akeno.

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:57.860
Both locations are too far away from here.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:00.840
And besides, those are Kisarazu AH-1Js.

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:02.480
They're Cobras fitted with TOW missiles.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.600
So cool!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:09.790
How many times do I have to tell you not to 
nerd out over military crap in my presence?

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.680
Go to school!

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.950
Trebor, this is Wizard 02.

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:23.540
Trebor, flying monster identified above Chimidoro City.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.290
Requesting orders.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:30.630
Central Air Defense Force Sector Operation Center (SOC)

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:33.760
<i>The flying monster has been 
identified above Chimidoro City.</i>

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.900
Flying monster? What on earth is it?

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:41.240
Perhaps it's Ra****n or King ****.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.100
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:41.100
<b>Self-censored</b>

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.300
Don't be ridiculous.

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:46.160
What if we're sued for 
copyright infringement?

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:48.800
<i>Intercept forces have arrived from Komatsu.</i>

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:52.240
<i>Komatsu 303 to Priest 23.</i>

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:56.860
<i>Estimated time of intercept 
is Priest next 1-0, next 1-0.</i>

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:59.990
Trebor, this is Priest 23.

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:01.910
Altitude is 32,000.

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:05.370
Priest 23, this is Trebor.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:07.620
You are under my control.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.580
Stay at 040.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:10.460
Roger.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:12.810
Where is the target headed?

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:16.740
Aircraft is currently turning 
2,000 meters above the target.

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:21.150
Sir, the F-2s leading the 
van are under attack.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.840
Permission to engage.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:27.990
But if the monster is shot 
down and falls on the city,

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:30.720
it could cause tremendous 
damage to civilians.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:35.960
Are we just going to let that monster 
rampage around above the city?

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:39.340
In that case, why do we even exist?

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:44.700
<i>Iruma's 1st Anti-Aircraft Division 
has entered the adjacent section</i>

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:46.530
<i>and is requesting permission to engage.</i>

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:47.610
Don't do it.

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:50.520
We can't afford to order Wizard 
to retreat from that airspace.

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:53.700
Sir, permission to open fire.

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:56.660
Contact the Minister of 
Defense immediately.

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:58.620
We don't have time for that.

00:19:58.620 --> 00:20:02.580
More than half the buildings in this 
sector have gone up in flames.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:06.120
The majority of residents 
will have nowhere to run.

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:09.330
Sir, permission to engage.

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.780
Let us engage the enemy. Sir!

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:18.310
We have no choice.

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:19.860
Open fire.

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:23.160
Wizard 01, this is Trebor.

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:24.530
You're cleared to fire.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.410
Kill the salamander.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.120
Trebor, say again.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:30.870
Kill the salamander.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:32.290
We have no choice.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:34.460
Roger.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.040
Killing salamander.

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:50.010
Mai!

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:01.830
All right!

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:04.760
Idiot, that's the ASDF 
F-2 that got blown up.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:06.400
It's falling this way.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:15.470
We're done for!

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:16.760
No way.

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:20.600
I'm the protagonist, but I'm 
already dying in episode 4?

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:22.220
I'm a regular cast member, too.

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:25.500
Maki Watabe held onto her camera 
right up until she died.

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:28.700
I still haven't done anything yet.

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:30.950
Doctor, how will you take 
responsibility for this?

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:31.510
No idea.

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:49.330
<b>Censored</b>

00:21:50.990 --> 00:22:00.420
<b>Chimidoro
Newspaper</b>

00:21:50.990 --> 00:22:00.420
<b></b>Chimidoro reduced to ashes!

00:21:50.990 --> 00:22:00.420
Panic
in
Chimidoro
as
fire
drake
appears

00:21:50.990 --> 00:22:00.420
<b>Scramble above the city: less than five minutes after the evacuation advisory issued, fighting broke out above Chimidoro, but the entire city became a sea of fire</b>

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:58.040
When the salamander shows itself, the night 
sky will glow like the afternoon sky,

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:05.410
a strange light will flash across the 
gathered clouds, and the world shall end.

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:59.990
<b>Episode 5 "Daddy Came"</b>

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:50.810
Since Mai will be staying with you, as her 
father, I'd like to ask you something.

00:23:50.810 --> 00:23:52.280
Yes?

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:54.120
What's your blood glucose level?

00:23:54.120 --> 00:23:56.540
Hold it right there.
